{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p>### 7-1. Sappaccayaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-2. Kusalākusalapadaṃ ^7-39a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17899.41970213733\">4:58:19</span> 1. Sappaccayaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaccayo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17908.156251074386\">4:58:28</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-2</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17914.445173019074\">4:58:34</span> 3. Sappaccayaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaccayo kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-3</p><p><br /></p><p>4. Naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17938.283866980928\">4:58:58</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17951.64488797139\">4:59:11</span> 5. Sappaccayo kusalo dhammo sappaccayassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17962.985241977112\">4:59:22</span> 6. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39b-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17968.987016736784\">4:59:28</span> 7. Sappaccayaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaccayo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-39b-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17978.241068211715\">4:59:38</span> 8. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-39b-8</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-39c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17985.26693711444\">4:59:45</span> 9. Sappaccayaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaccayo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39d-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17994.905073017166\">4:59:54</span> 10. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39d-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18000.284953165938\">5:00:00</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ (sabbattha ekaṃ, saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18009.048417025748\">5:00:09</span> 11. Sappaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-39d-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18018.19673502575\">5:00:18</span> Sappaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18027.073812899864\">5:00:27</span> Appaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18042.779037009535\">5:00:42</span> Sappaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18053.155926944688\">5:00:53</span> Appaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18063.430144135422\">5:01:03</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā dve, anantare ekaṃ…pe… nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye dve, purejāte ekaṃ, pacchājāte ekaṃ, (sabbattha ekaṃ), avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18071.984746135422\">5:01:11</span> 12. Sappaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. ^7-39d-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18082.880274811174\">5:01:22</span> Appaccayo abyākato dhammo sappaccayassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18090.557007066756\">5:01:30</span> 13. Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39d-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18094.552013003813\">5:01:34</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18098.716782011445\">5:01:38</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18102.676966954223\">5:01:42</span> Sappaccayadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 8-1. Saṅkhataduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39e-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18117.620902183105\">5:01:57</span> 14. Saṅkhataṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṅkhato kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ. Sappaccayasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-39e-14</p><p><br /></p><p>Saṅkhatadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 9-1. Sanidassanaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-39g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18116.941127874114\">5:01:56</span> 15. Anidassanaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anidassano kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39h-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18146.06891108011\">5:02:26</span> 16. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-39h-16</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-39i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18155.14255791989\">5:02:35</span> 17. Anidassanaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anidassano akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39i-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18164.55049708583\">5:02:44</span> 18. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-39i-18</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-39j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p>19. Anidassanaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anidassano abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39j-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18164.561308916076\">5:02:44</span> 20. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39j-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18170.793791937056\">5:02:50</span> Nahetuyā tīṇi (sabbattha tīṇi), nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, naāhāre tīṇi…pe… novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18184.162187837876\">5:03:04</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-39k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18195.986153116348\">5:03:15</span> 21. Anidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-39k-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18208.36218410109\">5:03:28</span> Sanidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18216.520051988555\">5:03:36</span> Anidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18232.037580897002\">5:03:52</span> Sanidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18241.118565146866\">5:04:01</span> Anidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati. Anidassano abyākato dhammo sanidassanassa abyākatassa ca anidassanassa abyākatassa ca dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati. (2)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sanidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – pakatūpanissayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Anidassano abyākato dhammo anidassanassa abyākatassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo…pe…. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18252.81066501526\">5:04:12</span> 22. Purejāte tīṇi, pacchājāte tīṇi, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme tīṇi, vipāke tīṇi, (sabbattha tīṇi) sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā pañca, natthiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-39k-22</p><p><br /></p><p>Sanidassanadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Appaccayampi asaṅkhatampi sanidassanampi na labbhati.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 10-1. Sappaṭighaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-2. Kusalākusalapadaṃ ^7-39m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18285.825412076294\">5:04:45</span> 23. Appaṭighaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39n-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18294.45944310681\">5:04:54</span> 24. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… vippayutte ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39n-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18301.178365154494\">5:05:01</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18304.72226699809\">5:05:04</span> 25. Appaṭighaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39n-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18314.226828925614\">5:05:14</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-39o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39p-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18320.997700225067\">5:05:20</span> 26. Sappaṭighaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Sappaṭighaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Sappaṭighaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho abyākato ca appaṭigho abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… nava. ^7-39p-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18351.446362835966\">5:05:51</span> Appaṭighaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho abyākato dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18361.86258792752\">5:06:01</span> 27. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā nava…pe… aññamaññe cha, nissaye nava, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte āsevane ekaṃ, kamme nava, vipāke nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39p-27</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18376.382434011444\">5:06:16</span> 28. Sappaṭighaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39p-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18388.95953090654\">5:06:28</span> 29. Nahetuyā nava…pe… novigate nava (sabbattha nava, saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39p-29</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-39q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18394.04268983978\">5:06:34</span> 30. Appaṭigho abyākato dhammo appaṭighassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-39q-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18401.540672003815\">5:06:41</span> 31. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe cha, nissaye nava, upanissaye dve, purejāte tīṇi, pacchājāte tīṇi, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme tīṇi, vipāke tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye pañca, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte cattāri, atthiyā nava, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate nava. ^7-39q-31</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18439.515947078202\">5:07:19</span> 32. Sappaṭigho abyākato dhammo sappaṭighassa abyākatassa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39q-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18447.237039853135\">5:07:27</span> 33. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39q-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18451.813516946593\">5:07:31</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18455.654320022888\">5:07:35</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18458.822507958037\">5:07:38</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sappaṭighadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 11-1. Rūpīduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39r-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-2. Kusalākusalapadaṃ ^7-39s-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39t-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18484.126469990846\">5:08:04</span> 34. Arūpiṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca arūpī kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39t-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18491.138518054933\">5:08:11</span> 35. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-39t-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18501.21639782605\">5:08:21</span> 36. Arūpiṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca arūpī akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39t-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18509.546912372316\">5:08:29</span> 37. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-39t-37</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-39u-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39v-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18519.727119000003\">5:08:39</span> 38. Rūpiṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca rūpī abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-39v-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18528.51070077722\">5:08:48</span> Arūpiṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca arūpī abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18536.80615692065\">5:08:56</span> Rūpiṃ abyākatañca arūpiṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca rūpī abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18548.39583303967\">5:09:08</span> Rūpiṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca arūpī abyākato dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18558.06248098779\">5:09:18</span> 39. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā pañca, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi…pe… aññamaññe cha…pe… purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme nava, vipāke nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39v-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18573.811814030516\">5:09:33</span> 40. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme dve, navipāke pañca, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne dve, namagge nava, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte dve, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-39v-40</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18597.9219069115\">5:09:57</span> 41. Arūpī abyākato dhammo arūpissa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39v-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18605.822448238036\">5:10:05</span> 42. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte satta, aññamaññe cha, nissaye satta, upanissaye dve, purejāte ekaṃ, pacchājāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme tīṇi, vipāke tīṇi, āhāre cattāri, indriye cha, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte dve…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39v-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18645.039385957276\">5:10:45</span> Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18650.868243042725\">5:10:50</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18654.53188203052\">5:10:54</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18658.486037219725\">5:10:58</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Rūpīdukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 11-1. Lokiyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39w-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-39x-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39y-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18679.190501115965\">5:11:19</span> 43. Lokiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-39y-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18689.857803024413\">5:11:29</span> Lokuttaraṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokuttaro kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18697.56109313733\">5:11:37</span> Lokiyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18705.43753810376\">5:11:45</span> Lokuttaraṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokuttaro kusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18713.70438810986\">5:11:53</span> 44. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā dve…pe… kamme dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomaṃ). ^7-39y-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18723.500152905395\">5:12:03</span> 45. Naadhipatiyā dve…pe… naāsevane ekaṃ…pe… navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39y-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18727.922602054932\">5:12:07</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18740.06725486267\">5:12:20</span> 46. Lokiyo kusalo dhammo lokiyassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-39y-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18747.076360960327\">5:12:27</span> Lokuttaro kusalo dhammo lokuttarassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18754.32000880469\">5:12:34</span> Lokiyo kusalo dhammo lokiyassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18761.014789835204\">5:12:41</span> Lokuttaro kusalo dhammo lokiyassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18765.988987880984\">5:12:45</span> Lokiyo kusalo dhammo lokiyassa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18775.968548070192\">5:12:55</span> Lokuttaro kusalo dhammo lokuttarassa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati. Lokuttaro kusalo dhammo lokiyassa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati. (2) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18792.49802580469\">5:13:12</span> 47. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve…pe… upanissaye cattāri, āsevane dve, kamme dve, āhāre dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-39y-47</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-39z-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39{-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18808.793275993896\">5:13:28</span> 48. Lokiyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39{-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18819.29265690845\">5:13:39</span> 49. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi sabbattha sadisā). ^7-39{-49</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-39|-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39}-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18830.672896082397\">5:13:50</span> 50. Lokiyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-39}-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18838.749122972535\">5:13:58</span> Lokuttaraṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokuttaro abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18844.515036094603\">5:14:04</span> Lokiyaṃ abyākatañca lokuttaraṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18852.389546036622\">5:14:12</span> 51. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… āsevane ekaṃ, kamme pañca, vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomaṃ). ^7-39}-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18865.209691094602\">5:14:25</span> 52. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā dve…pe… napurejāte cattāri, napacchājāte pañca…pe… nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, naāhāre ekaṃ…pe… namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte dve, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-39}-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18884.882275216674\">5:14:44</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18899.750387893186\">5:14:59</span> 53. Lokiyo abyākato dhammo lokiyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-39}-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18907.16166391455\">5:15:07</span> Lokuttaro abyākato dhammo lokuttarassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18915.480269990847\">5:15:15</span> 54. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cattāri, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe dve, nissaye satta, upanissaye cattāri, purejāte dve, pacchājāte dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme cattāri, vipāke cattāri, āhāre cattāri…pe… magge cattāri, sampayutte dve, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā satta…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39}-54</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18948.01892509766\">5:15:48</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Lokiyadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 13-1. Kenaciviññeyyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-39~-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-39-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-39-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18968.525702289917\">5:16:08</span>  55. Kenaci viññeyyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kenaci viññeyyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kenaci viññeyyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kenaci naviññeyyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kenaci viññeyyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kenaci viññeyyo kusalo ca kenaci naviññeyyo kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-39-55</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19000.728575996945\">5:16:40</span> 56. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39-56</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19005.581522856566\">5:16:45</span> 57. Kenaci viññeyyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kenaci viññeyyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19013.796513183104\">5:16:53</span> 58. Naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme nava, navipāke nava…pe… navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39-58</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19027.661875746704\">5:17:07</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19039.52907793496\">5:17:19</span> 59. Kenaci viññeyyo kusalo dhammo kenaci viññeyyassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39-59</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19049.40811691989\">5:17:29</span> 60. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava…pe… kamme nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-39-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19062.79253800286\">5:17:42</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19066.104596816895\">5:17:46</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19070.52143008011\">5:17:50</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19074.49255280831\">5:17:54</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ. Kenaci viññeyyaṃ akusalampi kenaci viññeyyaṃ abyākatampi kenaci viññeyyakusalasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19090.168144977113\">5:18:10</span> Kenaciviññeyyadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Cūḷantaradukaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":19102.462563}